WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
we all saw it

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:04,000
You brought back a cart full of food that night

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:05,800
It’s not easy for everyone

4
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,000
Share a little bit, right?

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,200
They are all people in distress

6
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,680
Let's help each other

7
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:13,280
We don’t want to bully a little girl either.

8
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:14,280
Hand over the food

9
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,000
We promise not to embarrass you

10
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,110
Please tell me, did you hear the nonsense?

11
00:00:20,110 --> 00:00:22,030
Open the door inside for me too

12
00:00:22,030 --> 00:00:23,590
Let everyone inside get out

13
00:00:23,590 --> 00:00:25,860
Use all the food and drink

14
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:28,260
I'll move them all to the door, otherwise

15
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:30,300
So I ordered this bucket of good stuff.

16
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:31,700
Let's all be born together

17
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:33,020
No one can live

18
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:52,560
What is this?

19
00:00:52,560 --> 00:00:56,250
Count you ten times
